<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Are Large Language Models Capable of 
<br class="ltx_break">Deep Relational Reasoning? Insights from DeepSeek-R1 and Benchmark Comparisons
<br class="ltx_break">
<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>This work is supported by the Research Grants Council of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, China under Grant UGC/FDS24/H25/24.</span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Chi Chiu So
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
