<section id="S4.SS2.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="S4.SS2.SSS2.6" class="ltx_text">IV-B</span>2 </span>Deduction of Target Relations</h4>

<div id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We apply the relational reasoning logic described in Section <a href="#S3" title="III Relational Reasoning Benchmarks ‣ Are Large Language Models Capable of Deep Relational Reasoning? Insights from DeepSeek-R1 and Benchmark Comparisons" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">III</span></a> to deduce higher-order relations such as <span id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">HasSister<math id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span> and <span id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">IsGrandson<math id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x,y)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span> etc. The output is expressed in Boolean vectors or matrices. On top of our illustrative example of father, mother, daughter and son matrices above, the Boolean matrix representing the <span id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">IsGrandson<math id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x,y)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span> relation is:</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="204.09" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 204.09" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,204.09) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.53 L 0 199.56 C 0 202.06 2.03 204.09 4.53 204.09 L 472.85 204.09 C 475.35 204.09 477.38 202.06 477.38 199.56 L 477.38 4.53 C 477.38 2.03 475.35 0 472.85 0 L 4.53 0 C 2.03 0 0 2.03 0 4.53 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.57 4.53 L 1.57 180.77 L 475.8 180.77 L 475.8 4.53 C 475.8 2.9 474.48 1.57 472.85 1.57 L 4.53 1.57 C 2.9 1.57 1.57 2.9 1.57 4.53 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.39 188.97)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.57em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="450.68"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.57em;">
<span id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example - Grandson Relation</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.39 82.22)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.57em;--ltx-fo-height:6.77em;--ltx-fo-depth:5.47em;font-size:10pt;" height="169.35" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 93.63)" width="450.68"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
